    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> is a challenging turn-based tactical game, blending the intensity of a board game with RPG mechanics (leveling up, skill unlocking, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersed in the dark universe of <strong>H.P. Lovecraft's work</strong>, you will explore iconic locations such as <strong>Innsmouth</strong> or the <strong>Mountains of Madness in Antarctica</strong>, while facing horrors from the <strong>Lovecraftian cosmology</strong>, including <strong>Dagon</strong> and <strong>Nyarlathotep</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an agent of the <strong>Order of the Enlightened of Arkham</strong>, tasked with eradicating fanatical cults that have emerged across the globe. But your mission will not be without danger: the more you fight cultists, the tighter the grip of the <strong>Elder Gods' rage</strong> will become, threatening your mental and physical integrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>innovative blend</strong> of board game mechanics and turn-based RPG strategy, <strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> offers a unique experience and a true challenge for fans of tactics and cosmic horror.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> is a challenging turn-based tactical game, blending the intensity of a board game with RPG mechanics (leveling up, skill unlocking, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersed in the dark universe of <strong>H.P. Lovecraft's work</strong>, you will explore iconic locations such as <strong>Innsmouth</strong> or the <strong>Mountains of Madness in Antarctica</strong>, while facing horrors from the <strong>Lovecraftian cosmology</strong>, including <strong>Dagon</strong> and <strong>Nyarlathotep</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an agent of the <strong>Order of the Enlightened of Arkham</strong>, tasked with eradicating fanatical cults that have emerged across the globe. But your mission will not be without danger: the more you fight cultists, the tighter the grip of the <strong>Elder Gods' rage</strong> will become, threatening your mental and physical integrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>innovative blend</strong> of board game mechanics and turn-based RPG strategy, <strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> offers a unique experience and a true challenge for fans of tactics and cosmic horror.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rage of the Elder Gods is a turn-based tactical game blending board game mechanics with RPG elements. Hunt down fanatical cults across the mythical locations of H.P. Lovecraft\u2019s universe. Face cosmic horror and survive the madness!",
